  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Framework Contribution LO-TCO 2013 South Allocatio - Framework Contribution LO-TCO 2013</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ramanslag LO-TCOS Bist&#xe5;ndsn&#xe4;mnd 2013 Sydanslag</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">LO-TCO Bist&#xe5;ndsn&#xe4;mnd &#xe4;r ett paraplyorgan med syfte att distribuera    CSO-medel till den fackliga r&#xf6;relsen. Medlen kanaliseras vida Svenska fackf&#xf6;rbund och deras internationaler (GUF) till fackf&#xf6;rbund och      -f&#xf6;reningar i ett 60-tal l&#xe4;nder i syd. Verksamheten &#xe4;r uppdelad i tre program (L&#xe4;rarfr&#xf6;bundet, Bygg, Offentliganst&#xe4;lldas Frb) samt fem      strategiomr&#xe5;den som f&#xf6;rmedlas via m&#xe5;nga olika f&#xf6;rbund.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LO-TCO Secretariat is an umbrella body with the purpose to distribute Sida CSO funding to the Swedish Union movement. The funds are         normally distributed through a Swedish Union, throught it&apos;s Global    Union Federation(GUF) to a Union or a Congress in some 60 development Countries. The activities are divided into 3 programmes (teachers     Union, Public Sector Workers and Woodworker Unions)and 5 strategies.</narrative>
  </description>
